{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13175","headline":"送包佶赋得天津桥 · 皇甫冉","name":"送包佶赋得天津桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳岁暮作征客，囗囗囗囗囗囗囗。\n相望依然一水间，相思已如千年隔。\n晴烟霁景满天津，凤阁龙楼暎水滨。\n岂无朝夕轩车度，其奈相逢非所亲。\n巩树甘陵愁远道，他乡一望人堪老。\n君报还期在早春，桥边日日看芳草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}